<title>ESTONIA: EBRD GIVES 39 MLN MARKS FOR HOUSING LOANS.</title>
<headline>EBRD GIVES 39 MLN MARKS FOR HOUSING LOANS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) said on Friday it has given 39 million marks to Estonia's commercial banks to provide housing loans.</p>
<p>EBRD has signed a housing loan agreement with Hoiupank, Hansapank and Uhispank , it added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
